 name, with the diagnostic naming the spelling written and its
 canonical keyword. Hand-verified across eight aliases drawn from
 different parts of the table (top, upper-middle, middle, and the last
 row), each compiled and run separately since a compile error halts the
 program at the first offending declaration and the other seven cannot
 be reached in the same run:

   abs        (line 5074, top)       -> absolute
   push       (line 5076)            -> append
   mod        (line 5123, middle)    -> modulo
   nil        (line 5126)            -> nothing
   show       (line 5134)            -> print
   grow       (line 5135)            -> resize
   stopwatch  (line 5149)            -> timer
   years      (line 5158, last row)  -> year

 All eight hand-run outputs, each its own `vox <file> -o p` invocation:
